":"text","value":"时，"},{"type":"math","value":"I = \\frac {E _ {1}}{R + r _ {1}} = 5 \\mathrm{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n安培力"},{"type":"math","value":"F = B I l = 5 \\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n方向水平向右（与运动方向相同）\n(1 分)\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"I = \\frac{Bl(E_1 - Blv_m)}{R + r_1}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n加速度为零时速度最大，F=f:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {B l (E _ {1} - B l v _ {m})}{R + r _ {1}} = f"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Rightarrow v _ {m} = 8 \\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（3）减速全程对时间应用动量定理（取运动方向为正；摩擦冲量作用于全程，安培冲量 Blq 只累积于电流存在的阶段，截止后 I=0 不贡献）："},{"type":"math","value":"- B l q - f t = 0 - m v _ {m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"q = \\frac {m v _ {m} - f t}{B l} = 3. 2 \\mathrm{C}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（4）充入电源的能量"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{回}=E_{2}q"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{效率} \\eta = \\frac {E _ {2} q}{\\frac {1}{2} m v _ {\\mathrm{m}} ^ {2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta = 20 \\%"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--shaoxing-zhenduan-2611-q18","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--shaoxing-zhenduan-2611","source_question_id":"shaoxing-zhenduan-2611-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"d8699d963dff5e4648b77f056087567668988ce514954d0447e6343a8592580e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （13分）现代科学技术研究中常要用到高速电子，电子感应加速器就是利用感生电场使电子加速的设备。基本原理如图1所示，上、下为两个电磁铁，磁极之间有一个环形真空室，电子在真空室内做圆周运动。电磁铁线圈电流的大小、方向可以变化，在两极间产生一个变化的磁场，激发涡旋电场，从而使电子加速。图1为侧视图和俯视图，电子沿逆时针方向，做初速度为零的稳定的圆周运动，已知电子质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m=9.1\\times10^{-31}"},{"type":"text","value":" kg、电荷量 "},{"type":"math","value":"e=1.6\\times10^{-19}"},{"type":"text","value":" C，圆周运动半径R=0.1m，穿过电子圆形轨道的磁通量 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Phi"},{"type":"text","value":" 随时间t的变化关系（定性关系）如图2所示，在 "},{"type":"math","value":"0\\sim t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时间内磁通量从0均匀增加， "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}=1.0\\times10^{-3}"},{"type":"text","value":" s， "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时刻后磁通量保持不变，电子做匀速圆周运动，轨道处的磁感应强度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}=0.01"},{"type":"text","value":" T。忽略相对论效应。\n（1）求 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时刻电子速度v和感生电场的场强E;\n（2）求在整个加速过程中电子运动的圈数 N;\n(3) 某时刻（记为 "},{"type":"math","value":"t' = 0"},{"type":"text","value":" ），电子位于坐标原点 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" ，速度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_0"},{"type":"text","value":" ，方向沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"+y"},{"type":"text","value":" 方向，如图3。此刻将原磁场改为区域足够大的匀强磁场，磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" ，方向垂直纸面向外；同时在轨道平面内加一匀强电场，电场强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" ，方向沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"+x"},{"type":"text","value":" 方向。求：（计算结果用题中物理量字母表示）\n① 电子在 x 方向和 y 方向的速度随时间的变化关系 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x}(t')"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y}(t')"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n② 电子在运动过程中的最大动能 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{kmax}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/01e636476687e996cef7e74b1869c05fa667d6cdcc8362a9866e5d5a80dcc912.png","width":363,"height":317,"width_mm":42.63,"row_group":"shaoxing-zhenduan-2611-q18-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/99856023d4de0c2c716b895f03e5223f588b8ce5a791207226ce4dc0016cfae8.png","width":261,"height":259,"width_mm":30.66,"row_group":"shaoxing-zhenduan-2611-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5ed15347d1b592a1ae73c7a22e76295692bd5039324fb7f5e56d2099a6c68344.png","width":506,"height":382,"width_mm":59.43,"row_group":"shaoxing-zhenduan-2611-q18-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图2\n第18题图\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2619db711b170abc5be552d6a44015d7d51e3d048bcfea94c1e1c45f233755eb.png","width":260,"height":365,"width_mm":30.45,"row_group":"shaoxing-zhenduan-2611-q18-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图3\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"t_0"},{"type":"text","value":"时刻后电子的速度大小\n洛伦兹力提供向心力："},{"type":"math","value":"e v B _ {0} = \\frac {m v ^ {2}}{R} \\Rightarrow v = \\frac {e B _ {0} R}{m} \\approx 1. 7 5 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {8} \\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"电子受到的切向电场力和切向加速度:"},{"type":"math","value":"v = a _ {t} t _ {0} = \\frac {e E _ {\\text {涡}}}{m} t _ {0}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n轨道处的涡旋电场强度："},{"type":"math","value":"E _ {\\text { 涡 }} = 1. 0 \\mathrm{V/m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n(2) 最大动能:"},{"type":"math","value":"E _ {k, \\max} = \\frac {1}{2} m v ^ {2} \\approx 1. 4 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 1 4} \\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n电子每运动一圈，感生电场对电子做功："},{"type":"math","value":"W _ {\\mathrm{每圈}} {=} 2 \\pi R E _ {\\mathrm{涡}} e"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n运动圈数："},{"type":"math","value":"N=\\frac{E_{kmax}}{W_{每圈}}\\approx1.40\\times10^{5}"},{"type":"text","value":"圈\n(1 分)\n（3）①运动的合成与分解（配速法）\n将电子的初速度"},{"type":"math","value":"\\vec{v}_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"分解为两个分速度：\n匀速直线运动，漂移速度"},{"type":"math","value":"\\vec{v}_{d}"},{"type":"math","value":"ev_{d}B=Ee"},{"type":"text","value":"，大小"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{d}=\\frac{E}{B}"},{"type":"text","value":"，方向沿 -y 方向做匀速圆周运动，速度"},{"type":"math","value":"\\vec{v}_{c}"},{"type":"text","value":"大小"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{c}=v_{0}+\\frac{E}{B}"},{"type":"text","value":"，方向沿 +y 方向开始"},{"type":"math","value":"ev_{c}B=\\frac{mv_{c}^{2}}{R},v_{c}=\\omega R"},{"type":"text","value":"圆周运动的角速度："},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega=\\frac{eB}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n(1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0"},{"type":"text","value":"时，圆周运动速度沿"},{"type":"math","value":"+y"},{"type":"text","value":"方向。电子带负电，磁场向外，由左手定则，洛伦兹力沿"},{"type":"math","value":"-x"},{"type":"text","value":"方向，电子逆时针转动。\n经过时间 t，圆周运动速度转过角度"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega t"},{"type":"text","value":"（逆时针），其分量为："},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {c x} = - v _ {c} \\sin (\\omega t), v _ {c y} = v _ {c} \\cos (\\omega t)"},{"type":"text","value":"加上匀速直线运动的漂移速度（沿-y方向，大小E/B）："},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {x} (t) = - \\left(v _ {0} + \\frac {E}{B}\\right) \\sin \\left(\\frac {e B}{m} t\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {y} (t) = \\left(v _ {0} + \\frac {E}{B}\\right) \\cos \\left(\\frac {e B}{m} t\\right) - \\frac {E}{B}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n②电子的运动是匀速圆周运动与匀速直线运动（漂移）的合成，\n当匀速圆周运动与匀速直线运动速度方向同向，\n速度达到最大值："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}+\\frac{2E}{B}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n对应动能最大："},{"type":"math","value":"E_{kmax}=\\frac{1}{2}m\\left(v_{0}+\\frac{2E}{B}\\right)^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}}]}
